WEBVTT

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.428
But our research tells a different story.

00:06:30.428 --> 00:06:33.055
JA: We met with Secretary of State
Madeleine Albright,

00:06:33.097 --> 00:06:35.558
who told us of the time
when the Russian government

00:06:35.599 --> 00:06:37.810
had bugged the US State Department,

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.479
a serious breach
in international diplomacy.

00:06:41.188 --> 00:06:42.815
After learning about the bugging,

00:06:42.857 --> 00:06:46.735
Secretary Albright
then went to her next meeting

00:06:46.777 --> 00:06:48.571
with the Russian foreign minister,

00:06:48.571 --> 00:06:50.281
wearing a bug pin.

00:06:50.322 --> 00:06:51.490
(Laughter)

00:06:51.532 --> 00:06:53.951
And enormous bug pin.

00:06:53.951 --> 00:07:00.958
(Laughter)